# Counselor web

Before changing `/provider` UI, read `docs/kb/COUNSELOR_WEB.md` and `docs/plans/2026-07-15-counselor-chart-ia.md`.

## Non-negotiables

- **Caseload** (`/provider/clients`) is the only counselor home. Do not rebuild a second plans queue as a home.
- **`/provider/plans`** stays a redirect (filter / highlight → Chart). Generate Week 1 + pending formulations live on Caseload.
- **Client Chart** keeps Layer-1 **Client story** rail on every tab (`IntakeContextRail`).
- **Logout:** never revoke session on GET `/logout` (prefetch). Sign-out via POST form only.
- Counselor/admin auth: **email** `/login`, not phone OTP.
- Engagement fetch failures → show unavailable; never infinite “Loading today’s progress…”.
- Light theme: do not apply dark `button` styles to `.provider-tab` without an exclude.
